          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_01",
      "hash64": "510DAA57FC29434D",
      "text": "Ragazzi, avete ancora fame? Posso portarvi\\ndegli spuntini, nel caso abbiate ancora spazio.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_botan_03",
      "hash64": "CA8C01C03806B4F7",
      "text": "Evvai, spuntini![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_friend_04",
      "hash64": "173BF59E992CF16A",
      "text": "M-Ma no, si figuri! Non si preoccupi, siamo\\na posto così!![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_02",
      "hash64": "510DA757FC293E34",
      "text": "Suvvia, non c’è bisogno di esser così ingessati.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_03",
      "hash64": "510DA857FC293FE7",
      "text": "Fate come se foste a casa vostra.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_friend_05",
      "hash64": "173BF69E992CF31D",
      "text": "R-Ricevuto![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_04",
      "hash64": "510DA557FC293ACE",
      "text": "Ah, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], è arrivata una lettera\\nper te.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_05",
      "hash64": "510DA657FC293C81",
      "text": "È da parte di un certo Riben... Lo conosci?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_06",
      "hash64": "510DA357FC293768",
      "text": "Ma tu pensa! Non sapevo avessi tutti questi\\namici![VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_07",
      "hash64": "510DA457FC29391B",
      "text": "Oh cielo, davvero...? Beh, in ogni caso credo\\nsia meglio la prenda tu.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_08",
      "hash64": "510DA157FC293402",
      "text": "Ecco, tieni.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_mama_09",
      "hash64": "510DA257FC2935B5",
      "text": "Bene, ora vado a prendere gli spuntini che vi\\nho promesso.[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_rival_03",
      "hash64": "F20984A16E90FD5D",
      "text": "Veniamo a darle una mano![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_botan_04",
      "hash64": "CA8BFEC03806AFDE",
      "text": "Chissà che c’è di buono![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_side01_0020_friend_06",
      "hash64": "173BF39E992CEE04",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], tua madre è incredibile...\\nNon sai quanto ti invidio![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
